<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACCESS MANAGEMENT</p><h1>Role & Izin</h1><p class="page-subtitle">Atur modul dan tindakan yang boleh digunakan setiap role saat RBAC aktif.</p></div><span class="admin-indicator"><span class="security-dot"></span> Admin only</span></div>
<section class="security-callout"><span>i</span><p>Role <strong>Administrator</strong> selalu memiliki semua izin agar sistem tetap dapat dikelola. Jika RBAC disetel FALSE, izin modul umum tidak diperiksa, tetapi halaman sensitif tetap khusus admin.</p></section>
<form method="post" class="panel permission-panel"><?= mc_csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save_permissions"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Matriks Hak Akses</h2><p>Centang izin untuk mengaktifkan akses role yang dipilih.</p></div><span class="panel-tag"><?= Rbac::enabled() ? 'RBAC TRUE' : 'RBAC FALSE' ?></span></div><div class="permission-scroll"><table class="permission-table"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><?php foreach ($rules['permissions'] as $permissionLabel): ?><th><?= mc_e($permissionLabel) ?></th><?php endforeach; ?></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($rules['roles'] as $roleKey => $roleLabel): ?><tr><th><strong><?= mc_e($roleLabel) ?></strong><small><?= mc_e($roleKey) ?></small></th><?php foreach ($rules['permissions'] as $permissionKey => $_permissionLabel): ?><td><label class="permission-check"><input type="checkbox" name="permissions[<?= mc_e($roleKey) ?>][<?= mc_e($permissionKey) ?>]" value="1" <?= $roleKey === 'admin' || !empty($permissionMatrix[$roleKey][$permissionKey]) ? 'checked' : '' ?> <?= $roleKey === 'admin' ? 'disabled' : '' ?>><span></span></label></td><?php endforeach; ?></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><div class="permission-footer"><span class="form-footnote">Perubahan berlaku setelah disimpan. Role admin dikunci agar tidak kehilangan akses.</span><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">✓ Simpan Matriks Izin</button></div></form>
